{"id":1190,"root":"قدو","bw":"qdw","tr":"q-d-w","found":true,"html":"<div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قُدْوَةٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> and <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قِدْوَةٌ</span> (S, Msb, K,) and <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَدْوَةٌ</span> (K,) <em>A pattern; an exemplar; an example; an object of imitation; one who is,</em> or <em>is to be, imitated.</em> (S, Msb, K, TA.) See <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اِسْوَةٌ</span>. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قِدْيَهٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span>: see <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فِدْيَهٌ</span>. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَادِيَةٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> The <em>first that come to one,</em> or <em>come upon one, of a company of men.</em> (TA in art. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طحم</span>.) </div>","pages":null,"shownPages":null,"chars":630,"entries":3,"shownEntries":3,"truncated":false,"match":"direct","key":"qdw"}